Package: biobench
Title: Biomedical Datasets for Machine Learning Benchmarking
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Imad", "El Badisy", , "elbadisyimad@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A curated collection of real (non-synthetic) biomedical
    datasets assembled from published clinical studies, cohorts, and
    trials, for benchmarking classification, regression, and survival
    machine learning methods. Each dataset carries a canonical
    literature reference to its original source study.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
LazyData: true
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
URL: https://github.com/ielbadisy/biobench
BugReports: https://github.com/ielbadisy/biobench/issues
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
